    "family": "laser_diode",
    "description": "450 nm 7 W blue multimode single-emitter Fabry-Perot laser diode (GaN-based visible edge emitter) in a TO90 metal-can package with an integrated ESD-protection diode. The laser diode is electrically isolated from the package/case, whose base plate is the sole heat-dissipation path (mount to a heat sink). This document encodes the 434-450 nm base wavelength bin (group/bin B53B60, ordering code Q65115A2158), rated 7.0 W typical at Iop = 3.7 A. There is NO back-facet monitor photodiode. Highly concentrated visible laser radiation - a Class 4-hazard emitter per IEC 60825-1.",
    "package": "TO90 metal can, leaded",
    "pinCount": 3,
    "lifecycle": "active",
    "temperatureGrade": "0..60",
    "orderingVariants": [
      { "orderCode": "Q65115A2158", "package": "TO90 metal can", "packing": "Group/bin B53B60; centroid wavelength 434 - 450 nm; Popt typ 7.0 W at Iop = 3.7 A" }
    ]
  },
